te": "2026-08-14 13:33", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878419529,47288722,814]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=65610553]来一份甜辣的甜不辣[/uid] (2026-08-14 13:31):[/b]<br/><br/>兔佬我也在看这个点位，目前看还是有人做多的[/quote]<br/><br/>没量，量还在缩，我感觉是量化的被动买盘，没动", "lou": 41, "content_length": 49, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 878419529, "postdatetimestamp": 1786685584}, {"pid": 878421679, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 25, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-14 13:50", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "我想动手了", "lou": 42, "content_length": 10, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1786686640}, {"pid": 878422545, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 35, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-14 13:58", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "不知道你们在怕什么[s:ac:茶]继续等你们的3800吧", "lou": 43, "content_length": 34, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1786687115}, {"pid": 878422698, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 14, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-14 13:59", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "我下班了", "lou": 44, "content_length": 8, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1786687184}, {"pid": 878422938, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 40, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-14 14:01", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "我感觉确实在楼里装b沾因果。。。。刚刚上板就开了", "lou": 45, "content_length": 47, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1786687288}, {"pid": 878424718, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 79, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-14 14:16", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "怪不得你们喜欢我，我的腚确实是肥美多汁[s:ac:嘲笑1]真的怀念之前科技情绪好的时候，一亮票你们只能吃尾气，现在一亮票立马回落，显得我水平很低", "lou": 46, "content_length": 122, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1786688170}, {"pid": 878426627, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 54, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-14 14:32", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "现在加急下单一条红内裤[s:ac:哭笑]<br/><br/>现在开始全力磕头，我说白了玩大A还就那老三样，我不磕有的是人磕，玄学是传统文化精髓，懂不懂", "lou": 47, "content_length": 109, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1786689171}, {"pid": 878428595, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 10, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-14 14:49", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "我就说磕头有用吧[s:ac:茶]学!", "lou": 48, "content_length": 17, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1786690174}, {"pid": 878681034, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 31, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-17 09:58", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "你们觉得今天能顶破压力位吗？今天早盘需要展现什么姿态，情绪标需要有什么表现才会构成突破压力位的条件？如果顶不破，市场会给什么预期？<br/><br/>看了一圈，狼楼现在是喜气洋洋，不错", "lou": 49, "content_length": 164, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1786931932}, {"pid": 878780422, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 22, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-18 09:04", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878779638,47288722,919]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67141873]偶像踩缝纫机[/uid] (2026-08-18 08:57):[/b]<br/><br/>今天可能会给一个低开或平开的加仓点吗[/quote]<br/><br/>宝宝，今天要是低开我主动割肉卖给你[s:ac:哭笑]", "lou": 50, "content_length": 37, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 878779638, "postdatetimestamp": 1787015085}, {"pid": 878790550, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 48, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-18 10:26", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "其实我有一个假设，是不是只要韩国这个b市场一开，我们的市场就不会正常走路了<br/><br/>我记得之前几次南朝鲜休市，或者没有外部因子参考的时候，我们走的都很正常", "lou": 51, "content_length": 143, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787019986}, {"pid": 878792820, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 4, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-18 10:43", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878791590,47288722,933]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67061787]活体流水楼[/uid] (2026-08-18 10:34):[/b]<br/><br/>[img]./mon_202608/18/axyfQ42-g9wbK1gT3cSi2-sg.jpg[/img]哇 什么东西[s:a2:自戳双目][/quote]<br/><br/>这种东西其实都知道不可能执行下去，绝对龙头哪有这么容易替代的，但是预期一旦有了，就容易让资金疑神疑鬼", "lou": 52, "content_length": 105, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 878791590, "postdatetimestamp": 1787021016}, {"pid": 878812683, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 27, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-18 13:49", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878811669,47288722,951]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=62871631]丶三笙有幸[/uid] (2026-08-18 13:38):[/b]<br/><br/>什么新主线能逆着4-5直接走吗？后面创业和KC50还有C杀呢[s:ac:汗]如果慢1天就踏空的行情能算行情吗[/quote]<br/><br/>我之前在紫光就是抱着国算新主线抱团的思路做的，最后拿脸接了两个地板走的，最后反思出的结论就是“长飞光纤“们只会出现在大级别上升浪中的调整浪，大趋势不变的情况下，才会有穿越题材，当大趋势下降时，不存在什么主线能硬的无视环境，如果有，说明现在也只是上升浪中的细分调整子浪", "lou": 53, "content_length": 271, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 878811669, "postdatetimestamp": 1787032167}, {"pid": 878896491, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 32, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-19 10:41", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "狼语翻译:<br/><br/>放量聊天，意思就是让你们多吹水，管住手[s:ac:茶]", "lou": 54, "content_length": 45, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787107272}, {"pid": 878917096, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 39, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-19 13:26", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "我过来一看，你们已经要开始猛干了吗，我怎么感觉要再看一下呢[s:ac:哭笑]是我胆子太小了吗", "lou": 55, "content_length": 72, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787117218}, {"pid": 878917943, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 18, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-19 13:34", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "我和狼头的入场点是一样的，这么长时间没白学，但是我是开融梭的513120[s:ac:怕]<br/><br/>要么上穿3943，要么下探颈线，今天我觉得科技没杀透啊，我没先手今天真懦了", "lou": 56, "content_length": 134, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787117689}, {"pid": 878922148, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 23, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-19 14:12", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "[E1787120098 0 0]\t", "content": "大盘一步到胃了，但是科技只有10个点能杀，除了科创和今天开盘买入商业航天的大A投资者可以享受超额收益[s:ac:嘲笑1]", "lou": 57, "content_length": 95, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787119932}, {"pid": 878926274, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 72, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-19 14:46", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "你们昨天敢满的，在狼楼里面嚎什么？你狼叔叔昨天说得清清楚楚，底仓都卖了，又不是收盘之后说的，盘中发的指导，还不够吊？<br/><br/>狼头减仓你们满仓，我只能理解成你们和狼头对着干，那就别找狼头按摩，找自己的模式按摩去", "lou": 58, "content_length": 200, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787121964}, {"pid": 878927973, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 38, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-19 14:59", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "我尾盘买了", "lou": 59, "content_length": 10, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787122743}], "__T": {"fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "topic_misc": "AgLQUfU", "subject": "自立自强，科学技术打头阵----救赎版", "locked": 0, "recommend": 0, "quote_to": null, "quote_from": 0, "type": 134283296, "replies": 24952, "authorid": 150058, "postdate": 1785481814, "lastpost": 1787283440, "jdata": null, "author": "-阿狼-", "lastposter": "华r东潇洒哥", "digest": 0, "lastmodify": 1787283440, "tpid": 0, "topic_misc_var": {"2": 47206901}, "__ST": {"fid": 510567, "tid": 47206901, "topic_misc": null, "subject": false, "locked": 0, "recommend": 0, "quote_to": null, "quote_from": 0, "type": 33792, "replies": 9, "authorid": 58, "pos